  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">生存模式</span>中，將一把<span style=\"color:#472904\">鋤頭</span>放入<span style=\"color:#843fa1\">物品欄</span>後，按下<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">F8</span>鍵即可開啟<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">c</span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">h</span><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">e</span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">a</span><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">t</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">s</span> <span style=\"color:#169179\">m</span><span style=\"color:#3598db\">e</span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">n</span><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">u</span>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>你可以將此模組加入多人遊戲，並<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">捉弄</span></strong></em></span>你的朋友。</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">新版本即將推出！</span></span></p>\n</div>",
